sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant HTTP as vLLM HTTP API<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant TGIS as TGIS gRPC Adapter<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine
    participant GPU as NVIDIA GPU<br/>CUDA API
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Engine,S3: Flow 2: Model Loading (Pod Startup)
    Engine->>HF: GET model weights<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    HF-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    Engine->>S3: GET model weights (alternative)<br/>Auth: AWS IAM / S3 keys<br/>TLS 1.2+
    S3-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    Engine->>GPU: Load model to GPU memory<br/>CUDA API

    Note over Client,GPU: Flow 1a: HTTP Inference Request
    Client->>RBAC: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/8443<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    RBAC->>HTTP: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000<br/>Auth validated
    HTTP->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>GPU: Tensor computation<br/>CUDA API
    GPU-->>Engine: Computation result
    Engine-->>HTTP: Prediction result
    HTTP-->>RBAC: JSON response
    RBAC-->>Client: JSON response<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,GPU: Flow 1b: gRPC Inference Request (TGIS)
    Client->>RBAC: gRPC GenerationService.Generate<br/>HTTPS/8443
    RBAC->>TGIS: Forward request<br/>gRPC/8033
    TGIS->>Engine: Bridge to vLLM engine
    Engine->>GPU: Tensor computation<br/>CUDA API
    GPU-->>Engine: Computation result
    Engine-->>TGIS: Prediction result
    TGIS-->>RBAC: gRPC response
    RBAC-->>Client: gRPC response<br/>HTTPS

    Note over HTTP,Engine: Metrics Scrape
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    Prom->>HTTP: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8000
    HTTP-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
